# Walkthrough for the Tauri app (Windows WebView2 in CI, or the mock-mode
# dev server in a browser). Works through the CDP backend.
wait 1500
shot 00-startup
# The three-pane desktop layout: no phone override on this window size.
assert !document.documentElement.hasAttribute("data-narrow")
key ctrl+p
wait 600
shot 10-command-palette
key Escape
wait 400
key ctrl+n
wait 900
key End
key Enter
# `type` waits for the editor to hold focus and verifies what landed; the
# assertion then fails the walkthrough if the text is not on screen, so a lost
# prefix can no longer slip into a screenshot unnoticed.
type Visual harness smoke test
wait 300
assert-contains Visual harness smoke test
shot 20-new-note
key ctrl+s
wait 800
assert-contains Visual harness smoke test
shot 30-saved
dump 40-dom
